        }
      }
    },
    "Allow screen sharing to continue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许屏幕共享后继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow screen sharing in the system picker. Your screen stays on this iPhone until a task sends a screenshot to your chosen model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在系统选择器中允许共享屏幕。画面留在本机，任务只会将选中的截图发送给你配置的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Stop Sharing appears, sharing is active. Tap outside the system panel to return to the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看到“停止共享”表示共享已经开始。轻点系统面板外的空白处，即可返回 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each task asks to share your screen. Sharing stops when the task ends; a full video is never saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务启动时请求屏幕共享，任务结束后停止采集，不保存完整视频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs keep step screenshots and logs for review. Screen sharing does not save a video." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务保存步骤截图和日志供复盘，屏幕共享不会保存视频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
